{"id":516,"title":{"romaji":"Cop Craft","english":null,"native":null},"slug":"cop_craft","synopsis":"The story is set in San Teresa City on the fictional Pacific island of Kariaena. The \"buddy police action\" series follows the detective Kei Matoba and the alternate-world knight Tirana.\n\n\n15 years ago, an unknown hyperspace gate opened over the Pacific. Beyond this gate lies Reto Semaani, a strange alternate world where fairies and demons live.\n\n\nSan Teresa City — a city where over two million immigrants live from both worlds. As a result, there are the haves and the have-nots. Here is the world's newest \"city of dreams.\" But in the shadow of the chaos, crime is rampant: drugs, prostitution, and weapon trafficking. The detectives who stand up to these heinous crimes are in the San Teresa City Police. When the detective Kei Matoba and the alternate-world knight Tirana — two individuals who differ in gender, personality, and even world of origin — meet, an incident erupts. Two worlds. Two justices. From this, the curtain rises on a buddy police action story!\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)","format":"TV","season":"SUMMER","year":2019,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:43:38","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 01:12:07","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":38940},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":106893},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":42174},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":14574},{"site":"ANN","externalId":22012},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":12683},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"HULU","externalId":null},{"site":"AMAZON_PRIME_VIDEO","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":1029,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/puj42P3w3qVh73Q0rgtAZYtp7WLQXt16RImOpEBw.jpg"},{"id":1030,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/0EIDhxZd1moGsIgq1wJIZZKgII1aMlCM21GAby9p.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":99,"name":"Millepensee","slug":"millepensee"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{